pars-image-writer (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Pars Linux.
  * Modernized GTK3 user interface and disk burning engine.
  * Support for ISO Mode (Windows UEFI/NTFS dual partition) and DD Raw Mode.
  * Integration with Polkit security mechanisms and desktop environments.
  * Complete project documentation suite added under docs/.

 -- Pars Developers <dev@pars.org.tr>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0300
